Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.05,0:00:03.76,Note,,0,0,0,,(走过的路)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到你的祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard your prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.97,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那个天使骗了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angel lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.94,0:00:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是他自称的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not who he said he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他的名字是 Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name,Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Gadreel为Metatron卖命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gadreel is working for Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron让Gadreel杀了Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron made Gadreel kill Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the one who caused.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,让所有天使都坠天的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the angels to fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.07,0:00:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他把我的荣光拿去施咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took my grace for the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.99,0:00:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说你现在是凡人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means your human.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.08,0:00:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,女王万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long live the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那是该隐之印\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the bloody mark of Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.59,0:00:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没有印记 初刃是无效的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the mark,the blade is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.51,0:00:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你本该领导所有天使 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to lead the angels,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.05,0:00:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想让我的人回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to get my people home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.67,0:00:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not the hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.60,0:00:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.35,0:01:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.78,0:01:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,当凡人的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is like to be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我慢慢觉得 初刃在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starting to think the blade is doing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.12,0:01:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,改变你\N{\fnArial\fs30}To you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.35,0:01:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有告诉他们 你的荣光是偷来的 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you told them about your stolen grace,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.42,0:01:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,惩罚他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punish him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.33,0:01:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.70,0:01:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚为了一个人放弃了整个天使军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass you just gave up an entire army for one guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.45,0:01:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他使用的是天使预言石的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's powering up with the angel tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.07,0:01:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron的神秘门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron's secret portal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.52,0:01:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,从现在开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}From here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.91,0:01:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我一个人说了算 明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calling the shots,capisce.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.54,0:01:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是来挑事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.07,0:01:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,请至少给我一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least give me a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.77,0:01:35.59,Note,,0,0,0,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.21,0:01:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,放下初刃 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the blade,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.14,0:01:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.77,0:01:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dean - Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean - Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.81,0:01:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.54,0:01:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.85,0:01:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.23,0:01:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有什么权利阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell if you think I'm riding the pine on this one guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.10,0:01:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 你现在很不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,something is wrong with you,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.32,0:01:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们查清楚怎么回事之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until we figure out what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:01:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你只能待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where you have to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.43,0:02:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你们能干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you two are gonna do what.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就凭你们两个干掉Metatron吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take on Metatron yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.45,0:02:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,真是 聪明啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's...smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.63,0:02:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你 你的天使军队已经不跟你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no,wait,you,you lost your angel army.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.12,0:02:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢 你现在想把\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you,you're trying to lock up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.07,0:02:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一能杀了那个混蛋的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one guy who has a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.72,0:02:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,给关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And kill that son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.79,0:02:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,计划得挺不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell of a plan,fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.46,0:02:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,hey,guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.95,0:02:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.31,0:02:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.75,0:02:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sam - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.93,0:02:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean wasn't wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.02,0:02:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我的人已经不跟我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My followers have abandoned us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.98,0:02:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是 但是Gadreel说他会帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,and Gadreel says he can help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.73,0:02:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,从我的角度看\N{\fnArial\fs30}From where I sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.27,0:02:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他的价值比天使军团更大\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's more than an even trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.88,0:03:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.13,0:03:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.77,0:03:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.29,0:03:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.85,0:03:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在写新的天使指南吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the new angel handbook you're working on or.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.17,0:03:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我在写一个故事 Neil\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a story,Neil.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.33,0:03:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一个精妙绝伦的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}A marvelous story.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.35,0:03:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,充满了爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full of love and.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.20,0:03:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,心碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heartbreak and.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.53,0:04:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还有爱 - 就像恋恋笔记本\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Love - Sort of like The Notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢恋恋笔记本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love The Notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.09,0:04:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.22,0:04:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.08,0:04:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,哪个让我看起来更可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which makes me look more pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.38,0:04:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么想看起来可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you wanna look pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你不久前刚刚整合了所有天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just reunited all the angels under the banner of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.51,0:04:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就像是 - 获了人民选择奖一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean that's like - Winning a People's Choice Award.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.46,0:04:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不过还是不太一样 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not quite the real deal now,is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.61,0:04:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 都好了吗 - 是的长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All set - Yes,sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.34,0:04:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,打开开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flip the switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.54,0:04:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,等亮了灯 一切就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait till the light and bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.50,0:04:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,所有天使 不管天上地下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And every angel in heaven and on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.77,0:04:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,都能听到我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 只能听到您\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and only you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.01,0:04:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,信号阻断了天使电台其他的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}The signal blocks out all other voices on angel radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.77,0:04:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,请注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.11,0:04:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我是Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.70,0:04:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我增强了混音效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}More reverb.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.05,0:04:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我是Lou Gehrig吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm Lou Gehrig.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.38,0:04:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry,sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.22,0:05:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,别再做那个手势了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.19,0:05:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我想在此刻对大家表示 欢迎回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to take a moment to welcome you all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.18,0:05:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你们知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.18,0:05:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你们接受我成为你们的新上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}How moved I am that you accepted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.38,0:05:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我有多么感动\N{\fnArial\fs30}As your new god.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.05,0:05:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我的心 可以说 是满满的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart,as they say,is full.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.08,0:05:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我想跟大家分享一些好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I want to share some wonderful news with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去小小的旅行一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going on a short trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.06,0:05:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,天堂的大门会暂时关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven's door will be temporarily closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.33,0:05:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,直到我再次归来 但是不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pending my return but rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.83,0:05:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都会解释清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}All will be explained.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.42,0:05:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,而且将会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.57,0:05:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,无上光荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.16,0:05:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.18,0:05:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,去把剩下的故事讲完啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}To tell the rest of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.55,0:06:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.92,0:06:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再找你们麻烦 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll leave you alone,I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.52,0:06:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是来伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not here to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.50,0:06:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.30,0:06:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,治愈我只会让你更衰弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Healing me will only weaken you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.98,0:06:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.62,0:06:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron吗 听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron,yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.01,0:06:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他要去哪儿 他到底要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he going?What does he want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕是 全人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid,humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,god.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.55,0:06:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为在打败Abaddon以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have thought you'd be more relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.90,0:06:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你会更轻松呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having defeated Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.06,0:06:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.50,0:06:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是个爱操心的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wear my stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.39,0:06:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.03,0:07:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,现在有这么多恶魔重新归顺于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}With so many demons having railed back to your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.89,0:07:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他们最应该做的就是 找到他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only natural that they would look to their.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.68,0:07:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,王\N{\fnArial\fs30}King.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,请求复命\N{\fnArial\fs30}For some...direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.30,0:07:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 如果我想让Phil医生帮我做精油按摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love,if I wanted a soapy massage from Dr.Phil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.75,0:07:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我会播快捷号码3的 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would hit three on the speed dial,all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.78,0:07:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry,sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.75,0:07:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 我觉得您被召唤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir,I believe you being summoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.00,0:07:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,还是个Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.51,0:07:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.18,0:07:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我到底怎么了 你个狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is happening to me,you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,喝高了 吃坏肚子了 我怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liquor before beer,bad taco,how should I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.83,0:07:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我停不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't turned it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.18,0:07:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,自从我杀了Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since I killed Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.47,0:07:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就好像被什么 困住了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like this whole...other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.88,0:08:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我很亢奋 我需要杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get this high and I...I need to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的真的很想杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean I really really need to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.72,0:08:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我不这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.60,0:08:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你就想把五脏六腑都吐出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You yak your guts out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.41,0:08:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是该隐之印\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.40,0:08:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.05,0:08:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,它会引诱你大开杀戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wants you to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.88,0:08:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀的越多 感觉越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more you kill the better you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.36,0:08:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,杀的越少 感觉越糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}The less kill the less better you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.25,0:08:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,能有多糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much less better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.98,0:08:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,能想到的最糟糕的情况呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}One would imagine the least best better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,就是说 死\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.38,0:08:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,该隐也有那个印记 但他没有死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,Cain had the mark,he didn't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.87,0:08:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,该隐是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cain was a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.98,0:08:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你的身体不够强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your body is not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.23,0:08:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,容纳不了初刃的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}To contain the blade's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我摆脱掉它呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.16,0:08:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你想摆脱掉它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.65,0:08:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我想杀Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I want is Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.84,0:08:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,说下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.87,0:08:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但我必须要先走出这扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have to get to that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,必须拿到初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have to get to the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.14,0:08:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你得帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.00,0:09:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,什么味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,硫磺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sulfur.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.32,0:09:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 赶快给我回电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,pick up the phone,call me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.32,0:09:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有开玩笑 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not kidding,all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.34,0:09:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样做 千万别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this,not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.57,0:09:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定是Crowley吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure it was Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.57,0:09:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,除了他还有谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else would he summon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.59,0:09:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,自从Dean得到那个印记\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean he and Crowley have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.83,0:09:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他跟Crowley动不动就厮混在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bromancing over the blade ever since Dean got the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.57,0:09:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,什么印记\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.59,0:09:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,该隐之印\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark of Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.45,0:09:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean就是用那东西砍我的是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's what Dean cut me with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.16,0:09:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The First Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.11,0:09:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那东西可能有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a way that could be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.44,0:09:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.50,0:09:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然Metatron变得比以前更强大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,Metatron is more powerful than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.16,0:09:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果Dean有初刃和该隐之印\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if Dean has the First Blade and the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.97,0:09:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那他可能是我们最大的希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That might give us our best chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.55,0:09:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're joking,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.41,0:09:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,一个小时前我们才把Dean监禁起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}An hour ago we're ready to throw Dean to a padded cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.70,0:09:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在你却说 他是我们的杀手锏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you say he's our best chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.56,0:09:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,听他说完 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear him out,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.36,0:10:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 不好意思 对不住了各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh right,excuse me,sorry guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 可我不是很想听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I'm a little less than eager to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.93,0:10:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们最有力的条件是对准弹头发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}That our best chance is arming the warhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.60,0:10:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,希望能一击致命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hoping it hits the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.37,0:10:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是在讨论一颗炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a bomb we are talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.85,0:10:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在说我亲哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.78,0:10:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你的亲兄弟不会是一个人在战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your brother would not be in this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.82,0:10:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会协助他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么协助\N{\fnArial\fs30}How.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.74,0:10:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道Metatron已经发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I belive Metatron has found a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.23,0:10:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,接入天使预言石的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}To tap into the angel tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.27,0:10:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这样一来 他所汇集的能量近乎于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harnessing its power to give him powers equivalent to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}God,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.93,0:10:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,其实从头到尾他的目的就只有这一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean that's what this is all about,isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.70,0:10:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron想成为上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron wants to be God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.51,0:10:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了 这下他无人能敌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great,well that basically makes him unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.10,0:10:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我们能切断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if we can break the connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron和预言石之间的连接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between Metatron and the tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.28,0:10:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就能把他打回原形\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would make him just an ordinary angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,预言石在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.00,0:10:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,在Metatron的办公室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.01,0:10:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,天堂里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}In heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.67,0:10:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我能带你们去神秘门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get us to the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.89,0:10:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.34,0:10:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,难道打开大门欢迎您吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean why would they let you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.43,0:10:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,如果Metatron的二把手与天堂头号通缉犯联手\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Metatron's number two shows up with heavon's most wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,基本就没戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gig is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.60,0:10:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam 我们必须搏一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam we have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.92,0:10:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的 Al\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.66,0:10:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我不管你今晚有什么安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what you got going on tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.43,0:10:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他也是你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's your kid,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.33,0:10:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说过了 他在吸毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm telling you he's on drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.41,0:11:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝啊 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my God Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.98,0:11:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.90,0:11:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.75,0:11:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not so sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.91,0:11:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,两位要来点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I get you fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.31,0:11:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,黑咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee,black.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.52,0:11:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.34,0:11:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你坐人家的桌子 占用人家的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take this girl's table,her time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.02,0:11:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,像过度发育的未成年一样往这儿一坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spread out like an overgrown teenager.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.11,0:11:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.74,0:11:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,一杯咖啡才多少小费 5分有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the tip a single cup of Joe,a nickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.16,0:11:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,双层芝士汉堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double cheese burger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.33,0:11:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,加全料 多加洋葱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything,heavy on the onions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.57,0:11:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.11,0:11:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你和麋鹿平时就干些这个 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is what you and moose do, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:12:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,在全国各地来回穿梭 搜寻邪恶势力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crisscross the country,searching for evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,正餐吃化肥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Order your nitrates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,同时游览当地风光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Partake of the local attraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.03,0:12:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.87,0:12:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你们从来不会厌烦这种鬼日子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never get tired of the rat race.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.59,0:12:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,从来没想过某天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never get the urge to just.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.65,0:12:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,撒手不干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bugger off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.29,0:12:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,对月长啸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And howl at the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.56,0:12:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,从来不会问自己生活的意义吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never ask yourself,is this it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.35,0:12:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是人生的全部了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this all there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.30,0:12:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我喝过人血 你了解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kicked human blood,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.47,0:12:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 所以你现在又要开始哭哭啼啼了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,so you are full metal douche again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.05,0:12:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那敢情好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well that's fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.35,0:12:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,要给你拿只泰迪熊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like a stuffed bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.78,0:12:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,只是想和你聊聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to make conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.01,0:12:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱怎么样 Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's hell,Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.39,0:12:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.74,0:12:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱就像一块瑞士表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell's like a Swiss watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不用你愁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱的事一言难尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.17,0:12:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,权利游戏也一言难尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game of Thrones complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,浴室性爱也不是一句能说清楚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shower sex is complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.25,0:12:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱三言两语可尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell ain't complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.02,0:12:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你的问题不在地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your problem ain't hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.40,0:12:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在于你自己 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's you - Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.54,0:12:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那你的麻烦又是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your problem then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.58,0:12:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron是我的大麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}My problem is Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.86,0:12:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,目前无迹可寻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And right now there's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.45,0:12:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不见天使互相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no angel smitings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.63,0:13:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没有上帝的神迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}No crazy acts of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.90,0:13:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有虫灾 冰雹\N{\fnArial\fs30}No vermin,hail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.37,0:13:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,如果Metatron真的打算在人间作祟\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Metatron's making his move on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.72,0:13:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他可真够有耐心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's taking his sweet ass time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.00,0:13:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,莫恐慌 是我的骑士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never fear,calvary's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.33,0:13:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,显然 你要找的天使一下子火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently your angel has gone viral.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.09,0:13:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,美国真是个好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that America is perfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.14,0:13:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,喂哥 那可是你妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo,dude that's your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.71,0:13:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.33,0:13:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,她死了 死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead man,she's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.28,0:13:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not so sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.02,0:13:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他 他在搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he...Is he freaking serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.56,0:13:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.03,0:14:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定录下来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you just got that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude what's you name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.16,0:14:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫Marv\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marv.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.17,0:14:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候拍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was this taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.27,0:14:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,2小时前 在印第安纳州的曼西\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Couple of hours ago in Muncie,Indiana.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.33,0:14:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他对她说了什么悄悄话\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he whisper in her ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.63,0:14:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.18,0:14:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你不吃了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not gonna eat your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.76,0:14:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.68,0:14:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,通往天堂的门在儿童游乐区里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door to heaven is in playground.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.53,0:14:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,由Metatron的两位心腹看守\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guarded by two of Metatron's most loyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.23,0:14:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是我亲自挑选的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recruited them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.73,0:14:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你之前说你有计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you said you had a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.80,0:14:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怎样说服他们 放我们进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we might convince them to let us pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:14:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,伍基人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wookiee.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.32,0:15:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全不明白你在说什么 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother,I have no idea what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.73,0:15:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,一部很受欢迎的电影里的梗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a reference to a very popular film.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.42,0:15:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.56,0:15:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Asariel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asariel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.61,0:15:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Asariel Purah 把门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asariel,Purah,make way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,门已经关上了 Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door is closed,Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.15,0:15:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron下令关上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}By an order of Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.82,0:15:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你们以为是谁下命令去抓Castiel的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who do you think give the order to capture Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.69,0:15:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你们觉得Metatron对于拷问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you don't think Metatron isn't interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.56,0:15:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,反叛军的首领完全没有兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}In questioning the leader of the rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.25,0:15:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须得重新画一次咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spell must be redrawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.47,0:15:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,越快越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}As quickly as possible then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.79,0:15:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.42,0:16:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我们之中还有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess one of us doesn't need a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不需要靠恶魔来发现线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}To help follow a clue trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.02,0:16:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你在找那个被奇迹治愈的姑娘 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are looking for Miracle Lady,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,她走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,she is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.94,0:16:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,走之前我和她谈了谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a nice chat with her though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.09,0:16:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sammy 无论你觉得你的介入起什么作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy,whatever kind of intervention you think this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.85,0:16:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 都不是你想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me,it ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.54,0:16:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再解释给你听了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not gonna explain myself to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.03,0:16:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I sort of get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.21,0:16:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,只是觉得你可能想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought you might want to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.35,0:16:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,就在你们俩在这扮演天生冤家的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you two have been playing Odd Couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.53,0:16:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你真正的朋友们 比如Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}You real friends,like Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.36,0:16:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,还有Gadreel 你捅了一刀的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the angel you stabbed,Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他们正在努力拼命\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are out there right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.21,0:16:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,帮你赢得这次战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Risking their asses to help you win this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.01,0:16:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.50,0:16:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这场战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fight I might add.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,本来可以简单直接许多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made that much more complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.29,0:16:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,而你却捅了那个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you decided to stab the one angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.57,0:16:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那个可以直接带我们去找Metatron的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who could actually get us to Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.84,0:16:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你是指那个附过你身的天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the angel that took you for a joy ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.28,0:16:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是那个害死了Kevin的天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angel that slaughtered Kevin,that angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.09,0:16:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,最初 是你让他进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you let in the front door in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.99,0:16:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是你欺骗了我 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tricked me,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.05,0:16:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,如今是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.94,0:16:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,常常在半夜被噩梦惊醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is to wake up in the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.38,0:16:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,看到是我自己亲手杀害了Kevin 不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing my hands killing Kevin,not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.71,0:16:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,所以拜托你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.56,0:16:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你说你不想给我解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you say you don't want to explain anything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那就闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.44,0:16:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.05,0:17:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我也明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I also get.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.24,0:17:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron必须要除掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Metatron has to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.32,0:17:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你是我们最大的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know you are our best shot to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.77,0:17:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我这次孤注一掷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take my shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.93,0:17:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,无论结果是好是坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}For better or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.82,0:17:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.61,0:17:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不论最后是生是死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.44,0:17:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.33,0:17:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但是如果这是最后一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.05,0:17:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are gonna do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.57,0:17:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你想知道他在她耳边说了什么 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know what he whispered to her right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.66,0:17:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那段视频里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the video.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.13,0:17:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是他的下一个目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}His next stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.69,0:17:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你们到底在磨叽什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are we all gollywagging on about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.90,0:17:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,快上车出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chop chop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.92,0:17:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.14,0:17:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不是你们的三号恶魔小弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not exactly demon minion No.3 here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.71,0:17:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,正如传说 我可是有法术在身的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the kids say I've got mad skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.62,0:17:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你到底在期待什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you expected here,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.45,0:17:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really care.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.00,0:17:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你要想现在退出\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you wanted off the hamster wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.97,0:18:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那就退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.18,0:18:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我已经被Winchester同化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I've been Winchestered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.62,0:18:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you boys good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.00,0:18:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这么说管用的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I thought it would help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.96,0:18:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经告诉Metatron了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sent words to Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.38,0:18:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他很快就会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will be back shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.76,0:18:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以在里面等他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can wait inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 Ingrid\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you,Ingrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.17,0:19:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.86,0:19:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,no,not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.97,0:19:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的以为你的小伎俩能骗得过我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really think you little ruse would work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.51,0:19:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.65,0:19:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到天堂监狱 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the heaven jail,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.77,0:19:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信Gadreel很乐意给你作介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe Gadreel can give you the tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.69,0:19:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,请问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰了 请问你是Marv吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry,but are you Marv.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.29,0:19:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的朋友 George\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my friend,George.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.71,0:20:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说 你创造了奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you perfor miracles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.91,0:20:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我确实有这个能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a burden I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.22,0:20:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,能施舍点儿麦芽酒给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little single malt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.55,0:20:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- George - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- George - What.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.88,0:20:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,先把你的糖尿病治好怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we take care of that diabetes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.83,0:20:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我在你水壶里留了点儿小惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left you a little something to celebrate with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.87,0:20:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.33,0:20:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.71,0:20:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白你什么意思 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I don't know what you mean,good sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.98,0:20:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一个什么好处也不给的的人怎么会是骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could one be a fraud when one offers nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.45,0:20:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,一点点爱 一点点希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little love,a little hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.24,0:20:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,偶尔来点奇迹 没别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The occasional miracle,nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.06,0:20:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我什么意思 Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know exactly what I mean,Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.32,0:20:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.98,0:20:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.32,0:20:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然他极力掩饰\N{\fnArial\fs30}And much as he'd like you to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.35,0:20:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但他跟你们不是同类人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.70,0:20:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.55,0:20:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我和他都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.53,0:20:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}An angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.55,0:20:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.38,0:21:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道是谁在偷喝George的酒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's been drinking out of George's canteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.71,0:21:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你不承认你以前是上帝的抄录员\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you deny you are the former scribe of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.42,0:21:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.89,0:21:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,一个既惹人厌又失宠的小气天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}A petty,unliked,unloved angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.43,0:21:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人们不想听\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people don't want to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.60,0:21:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他一味追求权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driven by the relentless pursuit of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.19,0:21:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没有别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.76,0:21:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这扯得太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is really gone too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.74,0:21:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他用非常手段把剩余的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's already brought the rest of the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.96,0:21:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,招揽到他的强权之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under his iron thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.13,0:21:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不停下来 我就不客气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I will you brother,if you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.21,0:21:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.33,0:21:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝的抄录员天使 得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angel scribe of God,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.74,0:21:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.38,0:21:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲眼所见的才是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is true is what I can see with my own two eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.74,0:21:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你要说他是个可怜又平凡的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna call him pathetic,common.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.39,0:21:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,请随意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.57,0:21:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿有谁不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who here isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.26,0:21:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但是谁有这个人的天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who here has the gift that this man has.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.93,0:21:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他做了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.18,0:21:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我想如果你看到了我所看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm afraid if you've seen what I've seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.81,0:21:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你只会憎恶他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd think him as nothing more than an abomination.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.39,0:21:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,憎恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abomination.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他是制造奇迹的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try miracle worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,或者救世主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try Messiah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.52,0:21:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这个更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.93,0:21:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.85,0:21:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.81,0:21:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我必须完成我的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I must do what my mission demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.12,0:21:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须保护你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.27,0:22:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,行不通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,that's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.73,0:22:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他们爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.73,0:22:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,非常非常爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They really,really love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.14,0:22:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,帮你一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.01,0:22:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,发现什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.11,0:22:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,恩 他就在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,he's up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.30,0:22:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就在一英里之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a mile up theroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.84,0:22:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,有个流浪汉营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a homeless encampment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.35,0:22:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来 那些人已经相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way the folks're talking,he's got them convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.92,0:22:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他是什么新耶稣之类的人物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's some kinda new Jesus or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.79,0:23:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.64,0:23:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.27,0:23:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen,Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.32,0:23:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,关于 过去这几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the,you know,the last couple of months.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.54,0:23:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.61,0:23:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们去砍人之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,before we find something else to fight about.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.25,0:23:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我 你准备好把他大卸八块了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me,are you ready to gut this bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.37,0:23:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry,little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.50,0:23:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s not your fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.36,0:24:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,照你说 是Metatron陷害了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,so you're telling me that Metatron set you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.95,0:24:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他安排了那些天使去自爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrange those suicide bombers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.41,0:24:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,让自己看起来像个受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make himself look like the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.70,0:24:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Gadreel是他的二把手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gadreel is his second in command.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.12,0:24:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,除了真相 还有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what other reason than the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.07,0:24:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,能让他反抗Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would he turn against Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.10,0:24:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我现在就应该相信你和一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now I'm expected to trust the word of an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.46,0:24:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,自从伊甸园事件之后就一直\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's only ever thought of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.07,0:24:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,只顾着自己的天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since the Garden and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.50,0:24:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.30,0:24:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不会再有天使因战争而死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a single angel more would die in this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.02,0:24:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我一直这么拼命是在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think I have been trying to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.41,0:24:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,拼命 拼命杀了Metatron吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying?By killing Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.60,0:24:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我们所有痛苦的根源\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the reason for all of our suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.99,0:24:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么都不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing you say matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.30,0:24:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你想让我坐以待毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you rather I not try at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.30,0:24:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你能证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if you can prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.38,0:24:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那就请给我们一个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}So give us a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.10,0:24:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,放我们出去 Hannah\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us out,Hannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.44,0:24:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.50,0:24:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我有什么能帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.27,0:24:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,放松点 首领\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy,chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.33,0:24:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你是Dean Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.89,0:25:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.80,0:25:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他说你会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said you would coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.89,0:25:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.97,0:25:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.91,0:25:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是Marv\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marv.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.48,0:25:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.72,0:25:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}In there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.87,0:25:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,为宽恕我们而祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praying for our forgivness.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.58,0:25:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,宽恕什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgivenss for what.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.74,0:25:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he,now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.20,0:25:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这监牢里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sat in this hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.73,0:25:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,苦等几千年\N{\fnArial\fs30}For thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.02,0:25:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,只为补偿自己的罪孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thinking about nothing but redemption.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.85,0:25:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,然后恢复自己的信誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of reclaiming my good name.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.34,0:25:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,无关他人 这一切都是我自己犯下的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought of nobody,no cause other than my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.24,0:26:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经洗刷罪孽了 我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been redeemed,my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.80,0:26:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,最后唯一重要的只有使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing that matters in the end is the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.77,0:26:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,保护那些不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protecting those who would not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.73,0:26:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,且不能够保护自己的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And can not protect themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.70,0:26:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}The humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.23,0:26:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们之中没有任何人比使命更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us is bigger than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.63,0:26:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能让我们自身的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not let our fears.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.39,0:26:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,和狂妄自大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our self-absorption.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.07,0:26:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,阻止我们去发现真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prevent of us seeing it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.02,0:26:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不能再这样下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.74,0:26:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不 当然不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.78,0:26:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,去监狱的另外一边 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move to the other side of your cell,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.74,0:26:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,别抬头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And keep your head down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.96,0:26:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.46,0:26:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,当他们提起我的名字时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they say my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.63,0:26:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,或许我将不再\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.46,0:26:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.62,0:26:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,只是那个将蛇放入园中的罪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be the one who let the serpent in.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.78,0:26:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,或许我会被称为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pherhaps I will be known as one of the many.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.70,0:26:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.31,0:26:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,重建天堂的英雄之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who gave the heaven the second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.64,0:26:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑吧 姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run,sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.86,0:26:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.51,0:27:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在相信他了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.31,0:27:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你这套忍辱负重的耶稣把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can save the humble-pie Jessus routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.64,0:27:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,在我面前就省省吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}For somebody who gives a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.37,0:27:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 你最大的毛病就是太愤世嫉俗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The problem with you,Dean,is the cynicism.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.49,0:27:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,一直都如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always with the cynicism.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.48,0:27:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是最卑微不堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,most people.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.42,0:27:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,生活在肮脏底层的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the real belly crawlers living in filth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.55,0:27:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,像是布伦特伍德这样的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Brentwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.97,0:27:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都不愿如此愤世\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do not want to be cynical.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.89,0:27:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只想要一个信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just want to something to believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.51,0:27:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that'd be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.19,0:27:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不能是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.95,0:27:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你只不过拉拢外面那些人们多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been working those people outside for.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.27,0:27:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一天时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}What,a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.80,0:27:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就已经为你抛头颅撒热血\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've already spilled blood in your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.44,0:27:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,而你不过是个长翅膀的诈骗犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are nothing but Bernie Madoff with wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.93,0:27:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我是个冒牌货\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I am a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.17,0:28:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底明不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.84,0:28:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道需要多少粉饰和美化\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much pancake make-up and soft lighting it took.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.74,0:28:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,才能让上帝履行一点职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get God to work a rope line.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.23,0:28:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他厌恶这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hated it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.34,0:28:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,人类意识到了这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know human sense that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.61,0:28:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他们更加虔诚地祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they prayed harder and longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.60,0:28:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,以他的名义发动无数战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fought more wars in his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.71,0:28:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,都为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for what.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.20,0:28:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,为了感染疟疾或者白血病而死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they could die of malaria,leukemia.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.94,0:28:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,终究只是责怪他们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all the while,blaming themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.51,0:28:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,哦天啊 我要是更虔诚一点就不会这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,If only I'd been more prayerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.30,0:28:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝就会爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}God would have loved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.62,0:28:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝就会拯救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}God would have saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.35,0:28:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,事实是 上帝连他们的名字都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?God didn't even know their name.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.97,0:28:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.12,0:28:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我行于人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because,I walked among them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.32,0:28:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我能拯救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.59,0:28:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 你能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure,you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.78,0:29:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你的大脸出现在每一本圣经上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long as you mug is in every Bible.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.13,0:29:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,所有保险杠上都写着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what would.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.63,0:29:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,相信Metatron会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron do is on every bumper.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.96,0:29:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.31,0:29:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在责怪我给了他们所向往的一切吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What,are you blaming me for giving them what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.35,0:29:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,给与他们一个信仰吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giving them a brand they can believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.98,0:29:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我在责怪你杀了 Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm blaming you for Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.35,0:29:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我在责怪你拿走了Cass的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm blaming you for taking Cass's grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.96,0:29:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那么多废话 我当然在责怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell,I'm blaming you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.08,0:29:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,让芝加哥小熊队在过去一百年\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the cubs not winning the world series.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.74,0:29:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,都没拿到世界职业棒球大赛的冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the last 100 freaking years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.25,0:29:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.05,0:29:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,都是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm blaming you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.06,0:29:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.07,0:29:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个麻烦的东西 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nasty piece of work,isn't she.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.08,0:29:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 Dean 假设你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,let's say you win,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.75,0:29:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.84,0:29:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那接下来的世界会变得怎样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the world left with then.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.84,0:29:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,一群娘娘腔天使还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}A herd of panty-waisted angels and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.64,0:29:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you out of you mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.69,0:29:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,天知道你现在血管里流得是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}With lord knows what pumping through those veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.17,0:30:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才说的我只听到了一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see,the only thing you said that went into my ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.11,0:30:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.72,0:30:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 来决斗吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine,we'll fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.80,0:30:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你还有什么期盼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.52,0:30:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,有谁会来帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is gonna come of all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.98,0:30:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,除非这就是你拖延时间的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless that's why you are stalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.50,0:30:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.26,0:30:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人会来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is gonna come of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.35,0:30:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你的同伙成功进到天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless your pals succeed upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.54,0:30:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉你个新消息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well here's a news flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.72,0:30:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你那两个矮胖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humpty and Dumpty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.14,0:30:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,现在正在主演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are staring in their very own version.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.13,0:30:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,天堂版本的异乡历劫呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of locked up abroad heaven right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.82,0:30:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那个从原始部落里拿来的蠢刀片\N{\fnArial\fs30}That big blade that douchy tribal tat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.80,0:30:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,真的给了你不少力量啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure gave you some super juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.85,0:31:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,放马来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.09,0:31:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,东西在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.41,0:31:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,把她带下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.58,0:31:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为搞定了Abbadon\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you took Abbadon's scalp.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.95,0:31:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,然后就可以对付得了我这个无用的小老头了是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you figured you take on litte old nebbishy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.08,0:31:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是哪儿出了差错\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.78,0:31:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你有那个蠢货的骨头提供能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're powered by the bone of jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.25,0:31:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,让你觉得很厉害 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is just awesome,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.77,0:31:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.61,0:31:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,下一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.13,0:31:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,试试用上帝之言的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to be powered by the word of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.70,0:32:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.96,0:32:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.26,0:32:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.38,0:33:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.02,0:33:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 看着我Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey hey hey hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.89,0:33:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这招妙啊 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well played Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.14,0:33:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,显然你和Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously you and Gadreel managed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.91,0:33:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,想了一些办法来逼我到死路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn a few dead ends against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.78,0:33:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Gadreel死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gadreel is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.30,0:34:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说Gardreel不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Gadreel bites the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.48,0:34:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,而天使预言石\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the angel tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.62,0:34:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙中有史以来最强大的工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arguably the most powerful instrument.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.41,0:34:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,变成碎片了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the history of the universes is in pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.00,0:34:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,都是为了什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.14,0:34:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.64,0:34:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,为了救Dean Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}To save Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.19,0:34:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是你的目的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there was your goal,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.74,0:34:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你虽然打着天堂的旗号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean you draped yourself in the flag of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.91,0:34:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这最终都只是为了救那一个人类 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But ultimately it was all about saving one human right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.80,0:34:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你猜怎么着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,guess what.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.36,0:34:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.66,0:34:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,而你竟敢坐在我的椅子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're sitting in my chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.75,0:34:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sammy你得在他离回来之前赶紧离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy you gotta get out of here before he comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.52,0:34:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,别说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.26,0:34:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,先用手按住这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just save your energy,alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.98,0:34:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会止住血的 我们会找个医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll stop bleeding and we'll go to the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.84,0:34:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,或者我们能找到咒语治好你的 你会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we'll find a spell.You're gonna be ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.75,0:34:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.31,0:34:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这样反而更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.17,0:34:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.10,0:34:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,该隐之印\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.59,0:35:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,正在把我转变成不好的东西 我也不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's making me into something I don't wanna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.92,0:35:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,别管什么该隐之印了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.18,0:35:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,等会儿再解决那个问题 你要坚持住 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll figure out the mark later,just hold on,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.13,0:35:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,靠我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.22,0:35:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你不可能成功脱身的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.01,0:35:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,从什么里脱身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away with what.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.77,0:35:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你给那帮没脑子的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told a silly story.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.39,0:35:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,随便编了个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}To a group of less than believers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.88,0:35:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我1个小时之内就能扭转回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll clean up your mess in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.59,0:35:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你太不看重我们的兄弟姐妹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave our brothers and sisters far too little credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.09,0:35:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他们很快就会发现 你一直在骗他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll soon learnt that you've been,playing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.48,0:35:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.17,0:35:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们什么都不会做\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.62,0:35:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他们就是一群吓坏了的小绵羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they are frightened little sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.45,0:35:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,盲目地朝我手指的方向乱跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Following my crook wherever it leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.16,0:35:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,而我将要带领他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where I'm taking them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.22,0:35:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,回到我们的家园 远离这里的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to our rightful place atop this mountain of.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.73,0:35:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,远离人类 羞耻 渣滓 等到那时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human,shame and excrement.When that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.48,0:35:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 他们不会介意过程是怎样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.They're not gonna care how they got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.07,0:35:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你之前不是说见死不救吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happen with you being okay with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.53,0:35:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我骗你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.21,0:35:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你个小混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't that a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.74,0:35:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你想过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.67,0:35:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你一直无法身居高位掌握大权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you could never quite pull it together,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.82,0:35:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你现在又只能坐在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you're sitting here with your.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.84,0:35:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,感受着身体里的荣光一点点燃尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace slowly burning away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.43,0:36:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你的名声一直无法维持起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your reputation long extinguished.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.92,0:36:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来就不好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}No curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.92,0:36:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你书读的不够多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't read enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.18,0:36:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,从来没学过 如果讲好一个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never learnt how to tell a good story.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.21,0:36:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.43,0:36:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.73,0:36:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam,等一下 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam hold up,hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.82,0:36:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我有话对你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gonna say something to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.37,0:36:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.70,0:36:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我真为我们骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm proud of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.27,0:36:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不不不 嘿 嘿 醒醒 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,hey,hey,wake up,buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.19,0:36:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.90,0:37:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.54,0:37:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.78,0:37:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你做得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.29,0:37:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,留他一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letting him live.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.82,0:37:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这是领导者的风范\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what a leader would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.75,0:37:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是什么领导者 Hannah\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a leader,Hannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.66,0:37:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,从来都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never was.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.66,0:37:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想做个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna be an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.22,0:37:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那你的荣光呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.12,0:37:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will you do about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.15,0:37:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不继续补充荣光 你会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will die if you don't replenish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.25,0:38:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的 Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it,Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.92,0:38:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是你把他拖下水\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got him into this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.02,0:38:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须把他救回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will get him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.45,0:38:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or so help me god.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.24,0:39:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.69,0:39:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.64,0:39:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我说话这会儿 他正在召唤我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is summoning me as I speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.51,0:39:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,做交易换回你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a deal,bring you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.31,0:39:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我之前说得一模一样 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's exactly what I was talking about,isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.74,0:39:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,一切的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all become so.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.05,0:39:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,又归在意料之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.83,0:39:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你要相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.26,0:39:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,当我怂恿你继承该隐之印的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I suggested you take on the Mark of Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.73,0:39:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不知道事情会发展到这个地步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know this was going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.60,0:39:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我也没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.31,0:39:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能没有告诉你故事的全部真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean I might not have told you the entire truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.72,0:39:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我从没说过谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I never lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.30,0:39:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没说谎 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never lied,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.08,0:40:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这一点很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.46,0:40:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是最主要的一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fundamental.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.99,0:40:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.14,0:40:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一则关于Cain的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one story about Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.67,0:40:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I might have.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.58,0:40:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,忘了告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgotten to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.54,0:40:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,很显然 他也想自行了断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently,he,too,was willing to accept death.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.85,0:40:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是变成嗜血的杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rather than becoming the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.67,0:40:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就像印记想让他变成的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mark wanted him to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.80,0:40:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他用初刃了结了自己的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he took his own life with the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.61,0:40:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.33,0:40:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.15,0:40:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就像传说里那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As rumor has it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.46,0:40:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,该隐之印不是那么容易摆脱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mark never quite let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.98,0:40:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该可以理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.33,0:40:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么没有告诉你这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why I never spoke of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.29,0:40:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,本来也只是一个推测 何必让人重拾希翼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why set hearts aflutter at mere speculation.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.64,0:40:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你召唤我的时候 我还没有意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't until you summoned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.85,0:40:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.52,0:41:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,直到你在餐馆点了芝士汉堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't truly till you leave that cheeseburger.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.44,0:41:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,却没有吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uneaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.22,0:41:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我才开始让自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I begun to let myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.53,0:41:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.94,0:41:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,也许真的会有奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe miracles do come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.83,0:41:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,听好了 Dean Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me,Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.92,0:41:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在经历的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're feeling right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.35,0:41:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不是死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not death.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.72,0:41:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,而是新生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.74,0:41:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一种全新的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new kind of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.03,0:41:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,睁开你的眼睛 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open your eyes,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.90,0:41:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,观我所望\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.09,0:41:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,触我所感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel what I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.10,0:41:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们一起对月长啸吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go take a howl at that moon.
